      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRICK (5) goes very well this trip starting 22 times for eight wins and six minors. Below best last time at The Meadows (30.54) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.25 lengths fifth. Looks a key chance on best form. DOONGALLA ADAM (2) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing fifth (23.83) in a Grade 5 at Horsham. Rates a winning chance on best. ONCIDIUM (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 5.5 lengths at Warragul in a handy 22.87 beating Zipping Scooby. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to his credit. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. KID (8) will have admirers again after placing at this track and distance last time out.",
